sequenceDiagram
title Control-flow block tour
participant Client
participant Server
participant Cache

loop Every minute
  Client->>Server: Poll for work
  alt is fresh
    Server-->>Client: Fresh data
  else is stale
    Server-->>Client: Stale marker
  else is missing
    Server--xClient: Not found
  end
end
opt Warm the cache
  Client->>Server: Prime hint
end
par Fan out
  Client->>Server: Task A
and Second branch
  Client->>Cache: Task B
end
critical Acquire lock
  Client->>Cache: Lock
option Timeout
  Cache-->>Client: Busy
end
break Fatal error
  Server--xClient: Abort
end
rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
  Client->>Cache: Highlighted exchange
end
